WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.033
Is your privacy under threat?

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:04.589
Has the age of privacy come to an end?

00:00:04.589 --> 00:00:05.840
Are you sick of Facebook's

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.000
lack of respect

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.220
for your privacy?

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.200
If you think

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.760
your privacy's threatened,

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.380
be glad you don't live in China.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.640
Chinese government wants to give

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:17.900
every citizen a score

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.107
based on behavior.

00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:19.980
Purchase history,

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.040
political leanings,

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.280
and social interactions would be used

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.500
to calculate a person's trust score.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.840
Facebook and Twitter

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.060
are banned in China,

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.640
so people use

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.820
So the government spies on that

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.060
round-the-clock.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.410
The state also monitors

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.200
the Chinese version of Amazon,

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.820
called Alibaba.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:42.648
Alibaba is by your side

00:00:42.648 --> 00:00:43.840
24 hours a day,

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.040
seven days a week.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.620
Why should we care what the Communists do?

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:48.920
We're not in China.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.100
Li Schoolland came to America

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.300
30 years ago.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.420
Here's Li when she was

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.700
16.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:14.920
She survived the

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.340
Great Leap Forward,

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:17.640
the Great Famine,

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.600
the Cultural Revolution.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.552
Her parents were doctors so

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:22.400
they

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.680
and she were

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:24.720
re-educated.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:32.600
And this was to teach you

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:33.900
not to be fancy?

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:42.380
The repression is over.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.620
It's all better now.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.020
Today in China,

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:53.820
if you tell friends about certain books,

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.200
your message will be blocked.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.960
Even innocent sounding phrases

00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:59.120
are censored.

00:01:59.120 --> 00:01:59.940
So I understand

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:00.680
the titles

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.900
of novels like Animal Farm,

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.480
Brave New World,

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:06.500
but Long Live the Emperor?

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:11.900
Well he's President forever.

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.420
They can't even talk about this teddy bear.

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:20.780
Winnie the Pooh?

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.240
And now, another step

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.420
more subtle than just

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:29.500
banning things.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.540
The state will monitor what you say

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:32.780
in social media

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:33.620
and assign you

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:35.555
a social credit score.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:38.890
That will tell them how trustworthy you are.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:39.600
The government says

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.841
this will allow the trustworthy to roam

00:02:41.841 --> 00:02:43.520
everywhere under heaven,

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.860
while making it hard for the discredited

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.680
to take a single step.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:48.880
There's gonna be this new

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:50.540
social credit score.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.780
Some American governments

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.480
already do something

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.200
similar.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.680
The LAPD can scan tens of thousands of

00:02:58.680 --> 00:02:59.860
license plates.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.440
Los Angeles police now practice

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.560
predictive policing.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.720
They pay a company called Palantir

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.344
to analyze social media,

00:03:07.344 --> 00:03:09.780
trace people's ties to gang members,

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:11.660
and predict the likelihood that

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.340
someone may commit a crime.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:16.160
After searching over a hundred million data points,

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:17.769
Palantir displayed an impressive

00:03:17.769 --> 00:03:18.760
web of information

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.500
on one burglary suspect.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.420
People like that.

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:23.060
They think it makes them safer.

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:34.240
I would like to know

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.780
that there's a trust score so

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:37.880
I can know who's trustworthy

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.360
and who's not.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.820
Sounds sort of appealing.

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:51.040
When government does gets involved,

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.440
bad things can happen.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.600
What happens if you have a low score?

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.200
If they really don't like what you say,

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.320
they lock you up

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:14.720
and torture you.

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.780
They didn't allow me to sleep.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.520
I was kept in a small room

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.960
and saw no daylight for half a year.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.420
But that's China.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:23.360
Why should

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:24.700
we be afraid?

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.020
Get out of my life!

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:27.380
In America, every week

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:28.320
on YouTube,

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:28.920
Twitter,

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:29.640
Facebook,

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.860
I challenge people in power.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.460
Trump does make things up.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.759
I say these things and

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.140
no one punishes me.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:38.140
So far.

